{"code":"001525","name":"동양우","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"건축자재","sector_desc":"시멘트·창호·인테리어 자재 등. 주택 착공과 건설 경기를 후행해서 따라갑니다.","desc":"동사는 1955년 동양세멘트공업(주)로 설립되어 1976년 기업공개를 실시하였으며, 현재 11개의 비상장 종속회사를 보유하고 있음. 레미콘 건재사업, 아파트 건설사업, 아크릴원사 및 부직포 섬유사업, 산업용 송풍기 플랜트 사업부문을 영위하고 있음. 건자재 네트워크, 건설서비스, 인프라엔지니어링 기반 솔루션 Provider를 지향하며, 전국 17개 레미콘 공장과 부산권역 3개 골재 사업장을 운영하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-28","n_days":300,"close":6500.0,"open":6200.0,"high":6510.0,"low":6200.0,"volume":204,"amount":1326000.0,"ret_1d":4.8387,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":4.7692,"ret_5":1.4041,"ret_20":-23.5294,"ret_60":-26.2202,"ret_120":-28.0973,"ret_250":-46.1921,"ma20":7096.0,"ma60":8262.8333,"ma120":8532.6667,"ma200":8863.85,"close_vs_ma200":-26.6684,"close_vs_ma60":-21.3345,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-74.5615,"r2_60":0.5747,"slope_120":-36.0203,"r2_120":0.3666,"slope_250":-27.0629,"r2_250":0.5537,"high52":18420.0,"low52":6020.0,"pos_52w":3.871,"dd_52w":-64.7123,"mdd_1y":-56.2764,"atr14_pct":10.4615,"vol_ann_60":110.3046,"vol_avg20":1187.9,"vol_ratio20":0.1717,"vr5":0.4762,"vr20":0.6198,"amount_avg5":5798882.0,"amount_avg20":8466465.0,"amount_avg60":15834433.1667,"obv_chg20":-46.9989,"turnover_20":9.0467,"pv_eff_20":-2.6009,"rsi14":42.8865,"frgn_net_5":-24.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0091,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0091,"frgn_net_20":53.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0202,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0202,"frgn_net_60":-382.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.1455,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.1455,"frgn_net_120":-1799.0,"inst_net_120":-2.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.685,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.0008,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.6858,"foreign_ratio":0.56,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.05,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-36.0,"op_margin_q":-2.4641,"op_qoq":58.6207,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-2.8571,"rev_yoy":-10.7514,"op_trend_4q":5.617,"fin_period":"202606","roe":1.65,"debt_ratio":95.33,"per":66.33,"pbr":0.86,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rat